# === Docs & tests (not needed in container) ===
apps/docs
docs
*.md
!apps/backend/docker-entrypoint.sh
# apps/landing/legal-plugin.ts renders these into /confidentialite/, /cgu/ and
# /mentions-legales/ at build time, so they must reach the build context. Both
# `docs` and `*.md` exclude them above; these two negations must stay after.
!docs/legal
!docs/legal/*.md

# === Test files ===
**/__tests__
**/*.spec.ts
**/*.test.ts
**/*.test.tsx
apps/backend/test
.maestro
playwright-report
playwright.config.ts

# === Logs & data ===
*.log
*_log.txt
backups
uploads
*.sql
# Keep Prisma migrations so `migrate deploy` works in the runtime image.
# Prisma 7 (multi-file schema) resolves migrations under prisma/schema/migrations.
# Migrations live one dir deep (<name>/migration.sql); the `*/*` form is honored
# by both the classic builder and BuildKit, whereas `**` is BuildKit-only
# (ACR's builder dropped it → empty migrations dir → no schema).
!apps/backend/prisma/schema/migrations/*/*.sql
!apps/backend/prisma/schema/migrations/**/*.sql
